<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Heat Acclimation Protocol</name>
  <description>Heat Acclimation Protocol — level 2

WARM-UP:
-10min ramp 50%->65% FTP (RPE 2-3)

MAIN SET:
-60min @ 63%-73% FTP (Z2, RPE 2-3, 85-95rpm)

COOL-DOWN:
-10min spin-down 70%->50% FTP (RPE 2-3)

HOW TO RIDE IT:
-Easy and conversational the whole way.

FUEL:
-40-60g carbs/hr.

HEAT PROTOCOL: ~60min at the prescribed easy zone with reduced cooling — skip the fan, add a layer, or ride the hottest part of the day. Hydrate aggressively before and during; sip past thirst. Stop if dizzy, nauseous, or confused — cool down and end the session rather than push through.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.65" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="92"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="3600" Power="0.68" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.70" PowerHigh="0.50" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>